{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1000_014mir", "source_sha256": "9c5c077ff9eac13b24e995e5f66cd54754c1beeb82593f26e8f0e1af017748b3", "ja": "{$P$}さん！　衣装着てみました～！\nどうですか、ワルい感じになってますか？", "zh": "{$P$}先生！　我试穿了服装～！\n怎么样，感觉变坏了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ecf8efcbe4878428e2531255a9e27a43582bdfe0d3c2155ba2a4a8033c9fcf16", "ja": "ああ。ワルくてカッコいいぞ、未来！\nいつもと違う雰囲気で、なんだか新鮮だ。", "zh": "啊。又坏又帅气哦，未来！\n和平时不一样的感觉，总觉得很新鲜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1002_014mir", "source_sha256": "ce7acc85e55940650660ff4a7504bc71b386789abed1e8d3762c4b39eae79d08", "ja": "ありがとうございま～す♪\nワルくて褒められるのって、なんか照れますね～。", "zh": "谢谢您～♪\n因为学坏被夸奖，总觉得有点不好意思呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1003_014mir", "source_sha256": "b55a1d0cd847990d379695b602ee539f27a2cb3b1fba332cdd77dc5059388f95", "ja": "この衣装って、捕まった人の服なんですよね。\nだからワルい感じがするんですね！", "zh": "这套服装，是被抓起来的人穿的衣服吧。\n所以才会有种坏坏的感觉！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1004_p", "source_sha256": "95aa33660c1191d38a7157e6afa68a0107903c854e216f9d8f9916be04c04d59", "ja": "そうだな。衣装も髪型もワルくて……あれっ？\n髪型も変えたんだな？", "zh": "没错。服装和发型都很坏……咦？\n你连发型也换了啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1005_014mir", "source_sha256": "71b77f6a4c014cd1d9359cbeaec6202c8df99617b2455a804cdfe1780ef55419", "ja": "あ、気づいちゃいました？　衣装に合わせて\n私もワルい感じにみえるようにしてみたんです。", "zh": "啊，被你发现了？我配合服装，也试着把自己打扮得坏坏的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1006_014mir", "source_sha256": "49bd0644456838c78dec13f22b6fb683fc35bad8ced961348f5d90237e1f06d9", "ja": "{$P$}さんに相談しないで\n変えちゃったんですけど……大丈夫ですか？", "zh": "没跟{$P$}先生商量就\n擅自换了发型……没问题吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1007_p", "source_sha256": "d7a76d11876ceb31e774057bc4fb11c5a678b73f8800d860b130dca3ea31d1cd", "ja": "未来が似合うと思ったんだ。大丈夫だよ。\nでもどうしてその髪型に？", "zh": "我觉得很适合未来。没事的。\n不过，你为什么会换成这个发型？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1008_014mir", "source_sha256": "137756ab3f3dceff0bbd3565d1e7d7fd5015f40a1729dea2ff9f95bf70d0e46a", "ja": "えっと……最初は変えるつもりはなかったんです。\nでもいつもの私だと、ワルい感じがしないんですよね。", "zh": "那个……一开始我没打算改变发型。\n可是平时的我，总觉得没有那种坏坏的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1009_014mir", "source_sha256": "05575c7a822df91dd59e980fdef3822e77ca2c83914d2c0d50011542ad795664", "ja": "だから、ワルい髪型にしようと思って、\nいっぱい考えたんですけど、全然思いつかなくて……。", "zh": "所以我就想着弄个坏坏的发型，想了好多，可完全想不出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1010_014mir", "source_sha256": "ca3657bf681a4f80b19bf0ebee44523c55fd2c03f7484e56fdca87a6c4386e4c", "ja": "それで、なんとなーく髪をいじってたら、\nクルクルーってなって……これに決めました！", "zh": "然后，我就随手弄了弄头发，结果变得卷卷的……所以就决定用这个发型了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1011_p", "source_sha256": "23d27cd08bd7a750508283f38c6e8ae359796b7367598824e664209401778bb8", "ja": "そうだったんだな。\n偶然とはいえ、未来らしくていいじゃないか。", "zh": "原来是这样啊。虽然是偶然，但很有未来的风格，不是挺好的吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1012_014mir", "source_sha256": "994fcb524516bf3882eef8348514b7aaa966fac7ba590540d8a572df7f7d1153", "ja": "ありがとうございまーす！　これで見た目は\nワルくなったから、次は中身を……あれっ！？", "zh": "谢谢大家——！这样一来外表就变得很坏了，接下来再把内在……咦！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1013_p", "source_sha256": "a1ead86d10761200e9e0ae830e82c205cdbf6d613308727653da737c37487c51", "ja": "どうした、未来？", "zh": "怎么了，未来？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1014_014mir", "source_sha256": "86dadd7d8de126ad16b96cbcfb959db0342524b43a0fd19b5d1b77a5628bb1f4", "ja": "あの、{$P$}さん……\n中身をワルくするのって、どうしたらできますか？", "zh": "那个，{$P$}先生……\n要怎样才能让内心变得使坏呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1015_014mir", "source_sha256": "ea67d99714e320ede1e6bf8e4d5d40b6d2a389efd6f71b55cde63770b5a8a2ee", "ja": "やっぱりワルいことをした方がいいのかな？　うーん、\nワルいこと……寝る前に生クリームを食べるとか？", "zh": "果然还是要做点坏事比较好吗？嗯——\n坏事……比如睡觉前吃鲜奶油之类的？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1016_p", "source_sha256": "614c3dac933848c1bf50a90cca4cb7dc1f985c41104d2817809624f8bd7fbc76", "ja": "たしかに悪いことだけど……実際にやらなくても、\n悪いことをした気持ちでいれば、きっと大丈夫だ！", "zh": "确实算是坏事，不过……就算不真的去做，只要抱着做了坏事的心情，肯定就没问题了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1017_014mir", "source_sha256": "e9ab2e2a898b9e1aac99b4b7deaeb39316f66a443d02fcb910dc719fbd616837", "ja": "そっか……。それじゃ、いつ逮捕されてもいいように\n気持ちの練習しておきますね！", "zh": "这样啊……那我先练习一下心理准备，免得什么时候被逮捕了都措手不及！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1018_p", "source_sha256": "62606ea4124eb677e50a95d3b4774dc9dc7d879944fbf530cbb64d2a5a72be2e", "ja": "（なるほど。見た目に合ったワルい中身か……。\n頑張り屋の未来なら、すぐに……）", "zh": "（原来如此。以未来的努力程度，很快就……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_014mir0324_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_014mir0324_1019_p", "source_sha256": "63e606098e5f5892e2e444a198c6fdd8665371ec31fa502bad44e88b8a574c0b", "ja": "（……なんだか不安だ。\nしばらく未来の様子を気にしておこうかな……！）", "zh": "（……总觉得有些不安。还是暂时留意一下未来的情况吧……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
